The film "elephants dream" was produced by the Orange Open Movie Project, and is liscenced under Creative Commons Attribution. Their website is [http://elephantsdream.org/]. This script is based on the script from their website, slightly adjusted to match the actual lines used in the movie.

||Speaker|English original|Lojban Translation
|Elephants Dream| xanto senva

Scene 1: Prologue
Proog|At the let we can see...|
|We can see...|
|At the right we can see the head snarlers|
|Everything is safe|
|Perfectly safe|
|Emo?|

Scene 2: Switchboard Trap
Proog|Watch out!|
|Are you hurt?|
Emo|I don't think so.. you?
Proog|I'm Ok
|Get up, it's not safe here...|
|Let's go|
Emo|What's next?|
Proog|You'll see!|

Scene 3:Telephone/Lecture
Proog|Follow me!|
|This way!|
|Hurry!|
|You're not paying attention!|
Emo| I just want to answer the ... phone|
Proog|Emo, look, listen!|
|You have to learn to listen|
|This is not some game|
|You, we, could easily die out here|
|Listen, to the sounds of the machine|
|To your breathing|

Scene 4: Typewriter
Emo|Don't you ever get tired of this?|
Proog|Tired?!?|
|The machine is like clockwork|
|One move out of place...|
|And you're ground to a pulp|
Emo|But isn't it -|
Proog|Pulp, Emo!|
|Is that what you want, pulp?|
|Your goal in life?|
|Pulp!|

Scene 5: Proog shows Emo stuff
Proog|Close your eyes|
Emo|Why?|
Proog|Now!|
|Good|
|What do you see at your left side?|
|Yes?|
Emo|Nothing|
Proog|Yes?|
Emo|Nothing at all|
Proog|And at your right,|
|What do you see at your right side?|
Emo|The same Proog, exactly the same|

Scene 6: Which way
Emo|Listen Proog! Do you hear that! Can we go here?|
Proog|There..? It isn't safe|
Emo|But|
Proog|Trust me, it's not|
Emo|Maybe I could...|
Proog|No|
Emo|But|
Proog|NO|
Emo|It|
Proog|NO|
Proog|Any further questions?|
Emo|No.|

Scene 7:Emo flips out
Proog|Why can't you see the beauty of this place?|
|The way it works... how perfect it is|
Emo|No, Proog, I don't see!|
|I don't see because there's nothing there!|
|And why should I trust my life to something that isn't there?|
|Can you tell me that?|
|Can you?|
|Answer me!!|

Scene 8: Emo creates
Emo|You're sick, man!|
|Stay away from me|
Proog|No!! Emo! It's a trap!|
Emo|At your left side you can see...
|The hanging gardens of Babylon!|
|How's that for a trap?|
| At your right side you can see...|
|Guess what! the colossus of Rhodes!|
|The colossus of Rhodes and it's here just for you Proog|
Proog|It is there|
|I'm telling you|
|It is|
